      <rules>
        <rule id="2c5410d6-a43d-a91b-5967-e3dc9353fcd4" name="Magic Ability (7)" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="89" hidden="false">
          <description>• Blight Storm (*Action) - Place a 5&quot; AOE anywhere completely in this model&apos;s commmand range. When an enemy model in the AOE is directly hit by an attack and the damage roll fails to exceed its ARM, it auomatically suffers 1 damage point. Blight Storm lasts for one round.

• Frostbite (*Attack) - Frostbite is RNG SP 8 magic attack. models hit suffer a POW 12 cold damage roll.

• Wind Ravager (*Action) - While in this model&apos;s command range, enemy models cannot make ranged attacks for one round.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="cf700cf4-2f85-c453-5138-c4305c5fed43" name="Spear: Magical Weapon" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="89" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="5463f2af-2099-cd68-f65a-0ca72e594b6a" name="Spear: Reach" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="89" hidden="false"/>
