      <rules>
        <rule id="89be4652-971f-c60b-88f9-9a8675a56e0e" name="Feat: Field of Slaughter" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="38" hidden="false">
          <description>While in Lylyth&apos;s contorl area, friendly Faction models roll an additional die on attack rolls this turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="658c46df-24ec-bee1-9286-7c99105c4079" name="Bushwhack" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="38" hidden="false">
          <description>During its activation, this model can make its combat action before its normal movement. If it does, it mst make a full advance as its normal movement this activation.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="c68ff455-d188-4d8d-f459-a71c96e296ae" name="Hellsinger: Magical Weapon" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="38" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="5378ffb6-b75d-1d32-8705-48a556cacfd4" name="Hellsinger: Blood Lure" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="38" hidden="false">
          <description>Warbeasts in this model&apos;s battlegroup can charge enemy models hit by this weapon this turn without being forced.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="66397238-5849-5db0-b25b-74e34ef7e773" name="Hellsinger: Witch Mark" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="38" hidden="false">
          <description>If this attack hits an enemy model during this model&apos;s activation, this model can target and automatically hit that model with spells, ignoring RNG and LOS, until the end of this model&apos;s acivation.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
