        <rule id="40b01ff3-4fdb-97b3-47d4-822aaecb983a" name="Bite: Critical Shadow Bind" publicationId="20446671--pubN73748" page="74" hidden="false">
          <description>On a critical hit, the model hit suffers Shadow bind for one round. (A model suffering Shadow Bind suffers -3 DEF, and for one round when it advances it cannot move except to change facing.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
