      <rules>
        <rule id="b56e63ed-5e6f-dd27-17d1-0410e82b30b2" name="Tentacle Lash: Chain Weapon" publicationId="20446671--pubN73748" page="76" hidden="false">
          <description>This attack ignores the Buckler and Shield weapon qualities and Shield Wall.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="a5179948-4710-36a0-6baa-584836644027" name="Tentacle Lash: Drag" publicationId="20446671--pubN73748" page="76" hidden="false">
          <description>If this weapon damages an enemy model with an equal or smaller base, immediately after the attack is resovled the damaged model can be pushed any distance directly toward this model. After the damaged model is moved, this model can make one normal melee attack against the model pushed. After resolving this melee attack, this model can make additional melee attacks during its combat action.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="45366239-1848-fb98-07b0-44fbea1ba876" name="Tentacles: Reach" publicationId="20446671--pubN73748" page="76" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="e6b48e6f-6fac-5093-e689-8e9913864d71" name="Tentacles: Chain weapon" publicationId="20446671--pubN73748" page="76" hidden="false">
          <description>This attack ignores the Buckler and Shield weapon qualities and Shield Wall.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="5566262c-ee5f-f260-a570-96bc04a1baae" name="Tentacles: Pull" publicationId="20446671--pubN73748" page="76" hidden="false">
          <description>If this weapon hits an enemy model with an equal or smaller base, immediately after the attack is resovled the hit model can be pushed any distance directly toward this model.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0b5875a7-fa55-61e6-3964-662641660a9c" name="Talon: Open Fist" publicationId="20446671--pubN73748" page="76" hidden="false"/>
