        <rule id="67a49587-0690-cf08-7667-0f4785aa4d9c" name="Strafe (d3+1) (*Attack)" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="67" hidden="false">
          <description>Make d3+1 ranged attacks targeting a primary target and ay number of secondary target within 2&quot; of the first target. Ingnore intervening models when declaring secondary targets. A secondary target cannot be targeted by more attacks than the primary target. Strafe counts as one attack fro ROF.</description>
