          <description>• Spirit Tap (*Action) - This model immediately casts the animus of a friendly Faction warbeast in its comand range as a spell. This model cannot cast an animus with a RNG of SELF. This model must make a special attack to cast an offensive spell. Other spells are cast by making a special action.</description>
