      </profiles>
      <rules>
        <rule id="de25010c-e988-9d48-0735-fdcaf453ec60" name="Feat: Dark Revival" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="46" hidden="false">
          <description>Return one destoryed warbeasts that was part of Thagrosh&apos;s battlegroup to play. Place it anywhere with 3&quot; of him. The warbeast forfeits its action this turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="0fcd5234-f5f5-5dd9-f513-d3f46a465318" name="Blighted Breath: Damage Type - Fire" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="46" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="d30f2163-c2b0-5eb0-92fd-b7f3bad7889d" name="Rapture: Magical Weapon" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="46" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="99ce1baf-ceb7-4c90-536b-fde5b2fe38fd" name="Rature: Reach" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="46" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="f51d707c-a8af-ba1e-c833-ec8a86f4a0b3" name="Rapture: Eruption of Ash" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="46" hidden="false">
          <description>If a model is boxed by an attack made with this weapon, center a 3&quot; AOE cloud effect on the boxed model and then remove that model rom play. The AOE remains in play for one round. Enemy models in the AOE when it was put in play are hit and suffer a POW 12 fire damage roll. Enemy models entering or ending their activation in the AOE suffer a POW 12 fire damage roll. Eruption of Ash damage rolls cannot be boosted.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
