      <rules>
        <rule id="1cc5042f-a587-2213-7ea5-a4833e442e57" name="Blight Breath: Damage Type - Fire" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="68" hidden="false"/>
        <rule id="a035e632-ce7a-0ab2-b7e4-cb8d11442cde" name="Bite: Critical Pitch" publicationId="20446671--pubN65952" page="68" hidden="false">
          <description>On a critical hit, instead of rolling damage normally you can choose to have thi model throw the model hit. Treat the throw as if model had hit with and passed the STR check of a throw power attack. The thrown models suffers a damage roll with POW equal to this model&apos;s STR plus the POW of this weapon. The POW of collateral damage is equal to this model&apos;s STR.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
